.TH CTPOOL_FUTURE_DONE 3 "2026-08-02" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
ctpool_future_done \- non-blocking check for future completion
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cthreadpool.h>

bool ctpool_future_done(ctpool_future *f);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns true if the associated task has finished (or was cancelled)
without blocking. Returns false if the task is still pending or
executing.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
f   Future handle (NULL returns false)
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
true if the future has a result or was cancelled, false otherwise.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR ctpool_future_get (3),
.BR ctpool_future_cancelled (3)
